(* \:8d70\:3063\:3066\:3044\:306a\:3051\:308c\:3070\:8d77\:3053\:3059\:3002\:8d70\:3063\:3066\:3044\:3066\:3082\:58f0\:304c\:9055\:3048\:3070\:5165\:308c\:76f4\:3059 (Realtime \:306e\:58f0\:306f
