(* v1.59: "Record" -> True = \:52d5\:753b\:306e\:305f\:3081\:306e\:9332\:97f3 (SlideTalkVideo \:304c gpt-live-1 \:306e\:3068\:304d\:306b\:4f7f\:3046\:3002\:8cea\:554f\:306f\:53d7\:3051\:305a\:3001
