(* ---- v1.47: \:8a08\:7b97\:30ce\:30fc\:30c8\:306e\:5358\:4f4d (CellTags "CNU:<unit>") \:3092 seed \:306e\:9805\:76ee\:3068\:30ce\:30fc\:30c9\:3078 ----
